   "short_description": "Alani Nutrition, also known as Alani Nu, is a wellness and fitness brand founded in 2018 by Katy Hearn and Haydn Schneider. The company is headquartered in Boca Raton, Florida, following its acquisition by Celsius Holdings in 2025. Alani Nu is recognized as the fourth largest energy drink brand in the United States, primarily targeting female consumers aged 18 to 24 with its sugar-free, low-calorie energy beverages.\n\nThe brand offers a diverse range of health and fitness products, including ready-to-drink energy drinks, pre-workout supplements, protein bars, dietary supplements, and lifestyle apparel. Alani Nu emphasizes fun flavors and functional nutrition, aiming to support active lifestyles and holistic wellness. Its products are available through major national retailers and online platforms, ensuring broad accessibility for health-conscious consumers.",
